    <!-- Dialog Strings -->
    <string name="dialog_notification_settings">Lifeline is an interactive story told over the course of several days.\n\nTaylor will stay in touch with you via notifications. Would you prefer each message to arrive separately so none can be missed, or for them to be clustered together to save space?\n\n{You can edit this choice at any time in the settings menu.}</string>
    <string name="credits_dialog">Lifeline was created by:\n\nDave Justus\nMars Jokela\nDan Selleck\nColin Liotta\nJackie Steege\nWilson Bull\nJason Nowak\nGhia Mercado\nBen Schwartz\n\nLocalization team:\n\nMatt Decker\nSteen Groennebaek\nArne Twigt\nYumi Okubo-Shuman\nLauren Warnock </string>
    <string name="dialog_game_over">Taylor has reached the end of this path.\n\nYou can now explore the rest of the story: tap on any past choice to change your response, or rewind to a specific day.\n\nYou may also activate Fast Mode in the main menu.</string>
